    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Quick Start",
      "id": "quick-start",
      "intro": "Mulai menggunakan Scenario Studio Canvas dalam beberapa langkah cepat. Panduan ini akan memandu Anda membuat dan men-submit rule deteksi fraud pertama dalam 5 langkah.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Navigate to Scenario Studio",
          "desc": "Dari sidebar utama aplikasi, klik menu Scenario Management untuk membuka daftar semua scenario yang ada. Di halaman ini Anda dapat melihat status, tipe, dan metrik dari setiap rule yang sudah dibuat.",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.04),0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);border:1px solid #eef2f6;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;border-bottom:1px solid #e2e8f0;\"><div style=\"width:28px;height:28px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#3b82f6,#2563eb);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(59,130,246,0.25);flex-shrink:0;\"><svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2z\"/><polyline points=\"9 22 9 12 15 12 15 22\"/></svg></div><div><div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Scenario Management</div><div style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;\">Sidebar &rarr; Scenario Management</div></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#475569;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.5px;margin-bottom:6px;\">Daftar Scenario</div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><div style=\"width:6px;height:6px;min-width:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#22c55e;\"></div><div style=\"flex:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:500;color:#0f172a;\">High Value Transfer</span></div><span style=\"font-size:8px;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:4px;background:#f0fdf4;color:#16a34a;\">Active</span><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">GENERAL</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><div style=\"width:6px;height:6px;min-width:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#f59e0b;\"></div><div style=\"flex:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:500;color:#0f172a;\">Velocity Check</span></div><span style=\"font-size:8px;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:4px;background:#fef3c7;color:#d97706;\">Draft</span><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">CONDITION</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><div style=\"width:6px;height:6px;min-width:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#22c55e;\"></div><div style=\"flex:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:500;color:#0f172a;\">Geo Anomaly</span></div><span style=\"font-size:8px;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:4px;background:#f0fdf4;color:#16a34a;\">Active</span><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#64748b;\">GENERAL</span></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#eff6ff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;\"><svg width=\"11\" height=\"11\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3b82f6\" stroke-width=\"2\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/><path d=\"M12 16v-4M12 8h.01\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#2563eb;\">Lihat status, tipe, dan metrik setiap rule</span></div></div>"
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Click Add New & Choose Rule Type",
          "desc": "Klik tombol \"Add New\" untuk memulai scenario baru. Pilih tipe rule: GENERAL untuk aturan sederhana (3 langkah) atau CONDITION untuk aturan dengan attribute binding (4 langkah). Untuk quick start ini, pilih GENERAL.",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.04),0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);border:1px solid #eef2f6;\"><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid #fde68a;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fffbeb,#fff);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><svg width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M12 5v14M5 12h14\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Add New Scenario</span></div><span style=\"font-size:9px;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#6366f1,#4f46e5);color:#fff;font-weight:600;\">Pilih Tipe</span></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"flex:1;border-radius:8px;border:2px solid #f59e0b;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fffbeb,#fff);overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(245,158,11,0.15);\"><div style=\"padding:6px 8px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f59e0b,#d97706);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#fff\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M13 2L3 14h9l-1 8 10-12h-9l1-8z\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">GENERAL</span></div><div style=\"padding:8px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"8\" height=\"8\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#f59e0b\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#0f172a;font-weight:500;\">Configure Parameters</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"8\" height=\"8\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#d1d5db\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#9ca3af;\">Build Flow</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"8\" height=\"8\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#d1d5db\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#9ca3af;\">Review &amp; Submit</span></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:4px;font-size:7px;color:#d97706;font-weight:600;\">3 langkah</div></div><div style=\"position:absolute;top:4px;right:4px;font-size:7px;background:#f59e0b;color:#fff;padding:1px 5px;border-radius:4px;font-weight:700;\">Dipilih</div></div><div style=\"flex:1;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#f8fafc;overflow:hidden;position:relative;\"><div style=\"padding:6px 8px;background:#e2e8f0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#64748b\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#64748b;\">CONDITION</span></div><div style=\"padding:8px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:3px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"8\" height=\"8\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#94a3b8\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#94a3b8;\">Configure Parameters</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"8\" height=\"8\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#d1d5db\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#9ca3af;\">Build Flow</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"8\" height=\"8\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#d1d5db\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#9ca3af;\">Use Condition</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"8\" height=\"8\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#d1d5db\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"6\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:8px;color:#9ca3af;\">Review &amp; Submit</span></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:4px;font-size:7px;color:#94a3b8;font-weight:600;\">4 langkah + attr binding</div></div></div></div></div>"
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Fill Step 1 \u2014 Basic Parameters",
          "desc": "Lengkapi semua field wajib di Step 1: Rule Name (nama spesifik seperti \"Transaksi Mencolok\"), Description (penjelasan logika deteksi), Risk Score (0-100), Priority (HIGH/MEDIUM/LOW), dan Active Period (jadwal aktif rule). Atur juga Cycle Indicator jika perlu pembatasan jam/hari.",
          "color": "#6366f1",
          "bg": "#eef2ff",
          "previewHtml": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;background:#fff;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.04),0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.04);border:1px solid #eef2f6;\"><div style=\"padding:10px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#eef2ff,#fff);border-bottom:1px solid #c7d2fe;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><div style=\"width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#6366f1,#4f46e5);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">1</span></div><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;\">Configure Parameters</span><span style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:8px;padding:1px 6px;border-radius:6px;background:#eef2ff;color:#6366f1;border:1px solid #c7d2fe;\">Step 1/3</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:12px 14px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#475569;min-width:72px;\">Rule Name</span><span style=\"font-size:9px;color:#0f172a;font-weight:500;\">Transaksi Mencolok</span><span style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:7px;color:#22c55e;font-weight:600;\">&#10003;</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><span style=\"font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#475569;min-width:72px;\">Description</span><span style=\"font-size:9px;color:#64748b;font-weight:500;\">Mendeteksi transaksi nominal besar dari merchant baru</span><span style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:7px;color:#22c55e;font-weight:600;\">&#10003;</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:7px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #f1f5f9;\"><span 