CONSTANT</div></div><div style=\"flex:1;position:relative;min-height:130px;\"><div style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:10px;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:8px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(99,102,241,0.2),rgba(99,102,241,0.1));border:1.5px solid #6366f1;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#6366f1\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:7px;font-weight:800;color:#4338ca;letter-spacing:0.06em;\">START</span></div><div style=\"position:absolute;top:30px;left:44px;width:2px;height:26px;background:#6366f1;\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;top:50px;left:0;width:90px;padding:6px 8px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #8b5cf6;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(139,92,246,0.15);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;margin-bottom:2px;\"><div style=\"width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(139,92,246,0.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"6\" height=\"6\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"3\"><path d=\"M8 12h.01M12 12h.01M16 12h.01\"/></svg></div><span style=\"font-size:6px;font-weight:700;color:#8b5cf6;\">LOGICAL</span></div><div style=\"font-size:6px;color:#64748b;line-height:1.2;\">Amount &gt; 10jt AND New Merchant</div></div><div style=\"position:absolute;top:56px;left:96px;width:2px;height:16px;background:#8b5cf6;\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;top:65px;left:104px;width:80px;padding:5px 7px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #f59e0b;box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(245,158,11,0.15);\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;margin-bottom:2px;\"><div style=\"width:12px;height:12px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(245,158,11,0.1);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;\"><svg width=\"6\" height=\"6\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#f59e0b\"><path d=\"M21 4H3a1 1 0 00-1 1v14a1 1 0 001 1h18a1 1 0 001-1V5a1 1 0 00-